                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \Omega_A
            is not guaranteed to exist in general. When the functor
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi U
                  %mo :
                  %mstyle{:mathvariant => "bold"}
                    %mi Ab
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                  %msub
                    %mi 𝒞
                    %mrow
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} /
