                      %mi A
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} A
          %h3#beck_modules_over_crings Beck modules over C^∞-rings
          %p
            The above proof also shows that Beck modules over
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/C%5E%E2%88%9E-rings"} C^∞-rings
            coincide with ordinary modules, once we recall that
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/ideals"} ideals
            of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/C%5E%E2%88%9E-rings"} C^∞-rings
            coincide with ordinary ideals and the square zero extension constructed above is a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/C%5E%E2%88%9E-ring"} C^∞-ring
            via
